url: 'https://ce-rise-models.codeberg.page/lci-dataset/'
abstract: >-
  A reusable, source-agnostic data model for life cycle inventory datasets.
  It represents activities, flows, flow objects, lifecycle stages, locations,
  classifications, source records, and quantitative exchange data for products,
  materials, components, and assemblies.
